 and a self-recommendation guard that penalizes advisor self-recommendations. `requireCommandPhraseAnchor` keeps a passing command row passing only when the explicit-author lane matched one of its own phrases or its slash string, or when it passes on meaning: a real embedder cosine of at least `COMMAND_MEANING_MIN_COSINE` (0.72) with a lead of `COMMAND_MEANING_MARGIN` (0.02) over the next command row. The word-overlap stand-in used under test never counts. `commandMeaningEligible` decides who may pass on meaning: a prompt matching `NO_EDIT_REQUEST`, the pattern `readOnlyRouteAllowed` also reads, rules out every command, and a read-only explainer admits only a command whose route only reads. `rankMeaningPassedCommandFirst` moves a meaning-passed command ahead of the top passing skill only when its cosine leads that skill's by the same margin. |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:\n  Line 20: import { COMMAND_ROWS, NO_EDIT_REQUEST, TRACKED_COMMANDS, typedCommandIn } from '../command-attach.js';\n\n  Line 677:   if (NO_EDIT_REQUEST.test(promptLower)) {\n\n  Line 881:   if (NO_EDIT_REQUEST.test(promptLower)) return false;\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/text.ts:\n  Line 5: import { isNoEditRequest } from '../command-attach.js';\n\n  Line 150:   const explicitNoWrite = isNoEditRequest(promptLower);\n","title":"grep","metadata":{"metadata":{"matches":11,"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Found 11 matches\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:\n  Line 289: export const NO_EDIT_REQUEST = /\\b(no edits?|no changes|without making changes|(?:do not|don't) (change|edit|modify|touch)|read-only only|no edits yet|only; do not|just show|just list)\\b/;\n\n