{"type":"text","timestamp":1794589680707,"sessionID":"ses_e2a208b1fffeNIFIjpO6KZHamD","part":{"id":"prt_1d5e155e0001L1Bmomk33ssxuT","sessionID":"ses_e2a208b1fffeNIFIjpO6KZHamD","messageID":"msg_1d5e14c4d001p57ZcTxu3oC7A7","type":"text","text":"T005 is complete. Only the two files the task names were touched, and the checkbox in `tasks.md` is left unticked as instructed.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts` — added `rules out every command when the prompt asks for no change with a curly apostrophe` inside `describe('commandMeaningEligible')`, using the `don\\u2019t touch anything` prompt and expecting both the mutating and read-only command to be refused.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts` — the `../command-attach.js` import now brings in `isNoEditRequest` in place of `NO_EDIT_REQUEST`, and both gates (`readOnlyRouteAllowed` and `commandMeaningEligible`) call `isNoEditRequest(promptLower)`.\n\n**Verify output**\n\nFailing run before the source change (the new case returned `true`, as required):\n\n```\n FAIL  tests/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts > commandMeaningEligible > rules out every command when the prompt asks for no change with a curly apostrophe\nAssertionError: expected true to be false // Object.is equality\n Test Files  1 failed (1)\n      Tests  1 failed | 17 passed (18)\n```\n\n`VX tests/command-meaning-anchor.vitest.ts` after the change:\n\n```\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\n      Tests  18 passed (18)\n```\n\n`rg -c \"isNoEditRequest\\(promptLower\\)\" $FU` printed `2` (exit 0). `rg -c \"NO_EDIT_REQUEST\" $FU` printed nothing (exit 1). `TC` (`npm run typecheck` in `ADV`) printed `typecheck exit=0`, and `git diff --stat` confirms the change is limited to those two files (11 insertions, 3 deletions).\n\nOne note for the orchestrator: `lib/scorer/README.md` still describes the old `NO_EDIT_REQUEST` name in its `fusion.ts` row. That file is outside T005's named files, so I left it alone.","time":{"start":1794589677024,"end":1794589680707}}}
